IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PEN0005.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY PEN0005C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==TX==.
01 OUT-RECORD.
    05 PENALTY-WAIVED     PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 LATE-CHARGE        PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM FIRST-OFFENSE-WAIVER
    DISPLAY "PENALTY-WAIVED=" PENALTY-WAIVED
    DISPLAY "LATE-CHARGE=" LATE-CHARGE
    STOP RUN.
FIRST-OFFENSE-WAIVER.
    IF TX-FIRST-OFFENSE = 'Y'
        IF TX-CUSTOMER-TIER = 'G' OR 'P'
            MOVE 'Y' TO PENALTY-WAIVED
            MOVE 0 TO LATE-CHARGE
        ELSE IF TX-DAYS-PAST-DUE <= 3
            MOVE 'Y' TO PENALTY-WAIVED
            MOVE 0 TO LATE-CHARGE
        END-IF
        END-IF
    END-IF.
